# HR Policy Navigator (HRPN) — architecture scenes

Focus/xyflow scenes for the HRPN ARD decision dossier, in the format of the D2D Focus dossier
(quoted Mermaid subset parsed by `docs/architecture/tooling/chain/parse-mermaid.mjs`, cards and layout in
`scene-metadata.mjs`, evidence per card in `EVIDENCE.md`). Built and layout-checked by `node build-scenes.mjs`.

Tints: blue `genair` = native GenAiR template / Cutter / AgentGarden code; yellow `specific` = HRPN-specific
code (commits after "Created with GenAiR-cutter", 2026-09-25 → 2026-10-12); orange `added` = target addition
needed; red `removed` = to remove in the target; red frame `risk` = present but weak or at risk; no tint =
Google or third-party managed service. Dashed links = dormant, optional or not built.

Scene order: option 2 first (source of truth = this repository), then options 1 and 3.

